{"id":"event_redash2_01_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40032","label":"RED ASH · Part 2"},"label":"Passing of Time: A","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"event_redash2_01_e","speakers":{"liliweiss":"Liliweiss","commander":"Commander","dorothy":"Dorothy","hongryeon_o":"Scarlet","rapunzel_o":"Rapunzel"},"icons":{"liliweiss":"si_c943_00_s","commander":"si_c942_00_s","dorothy":"si_c233_00_s","hongryeon_o":"si_c225_00_s","rapunzel_o":"si_c966_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_1","text":"Goddess Squad briefing room.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_redash_ashsmoke","movie":null,"shown":["liliweiss","commander","dorothy","hongryeon_o"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_2","text":"We've received reports of a large mass of Raptures heading towards the entrance to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_3","text":"If they keep their current pace, they'll arrive in 3 days.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_4","text":"We'll have to intercept.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_5","text":"Anything about them that we should pay particular attention to?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_6","text":"No. The group consists entirely of older models, and we've only detected two colossal Raptures in their midst.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_7","text":"Noted. Then let's hurry and finish them off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_8","text":"When are we planning on leaving?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_9","text":"In 1 hour. Everyone get ready.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_10","text":"Might thou not be somewhat hasty in making this decision?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_11","text":"'Twas but yesterday we were engaged in a formidable skirmish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_12","text":"To be exact, we've had successive battlefield engagements for 2 weeks straight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_13","text":"It can't be helped.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_14","text":"It's been two months since humanity accepted defeat and evacuated to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_15","text":"The migration was organized in secret, but the Raptures somehow caught on to our plan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_16","text":"Might I remind you all how many times the Raptures have laid siege to the Ark's entrance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_17","text":"212 times and that's only based on official reports.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_18","text":"Actually, Commander, it's 221.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_19","text":"Either way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_20","text":"These creatures are trying everything in their power to breach the entrance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_21","text":"That's why we're moving all of our forces towards the Ark entrance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_22","text":"We cannot afford to lose this position.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_23","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_24","text":"I know moving out so soon seems rash,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_25","text":"but if we don't move quickly, it could mean extinction for all of mankind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_26","text":"The other teams are doing everything they can to hold them back, but it's not enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_27","text":"They need us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_28","text":"The Goddess Squad. The Goddesses of Victory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_29","text":"... I understand. Perchance I was somewhat hasty in my reproachment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_30","text":"I'll get ready.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_31","text":"What about Rapunzel and Snow White?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_32","text":"They're off in their own worlds, as usual.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_33","text":"Can you bring them here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_34","text":"Rapunzel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Laboratory","bgArt":"laboratory","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["rapunzel_o"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_35","text":"Yes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_36","text":"Get ready. We're moving out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_37","text":"Again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_38","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_39","text":"Understood.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_40","text":"How's the research coming along?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_41","text":"Intermittently. But I've figured out the basic principles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_42","text":"This so-called corruption contaminates the nanomachines in our brains,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_43","text":"and twists our mindset into that of Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_44","text":"You could consider it a form of warped hypnosis.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_45","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_46","text":"If you're not familiar with the concept of hypnosis, it's when...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_47","text":"That's fine. You can tell me about it later.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_48","text":"I just want to know if there's a cure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_49","text":"In theory, before the corruption spreads too far, all you should have to do is remove the nanomachines.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_50","text":"Unfortunately, that's easier said than done.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_51","text":"The United Forces of Humanity, or the Central Government rather, and the V.T.C. are proposing only one solution:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_52","text":"immediate and total destruction of the brain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_53","text":"There is a temporary solution that we're calling cryogenic sleep, but its efficacy remains in question.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_54","text":"If only Red Hood were here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_55","text":"She was able to maintain control of her senses for all that time...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_56","text":"Yes, but such cases are exceedingly rare.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_57","text":"That's putting it mildly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_58","text":"So far, Red Hood has been the only one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_enormousgap","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_59","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_60","text":"I never saw a case like hers, where she was able to stave off the effects for so long.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_61","text":"You speak about her as if she's already dead. She could still be alive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_62","text":"Oh, how I wish that were true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_63","text":"When she left, she was nearing the end already.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_64","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_65","text":"Before she walked away, I made a promise.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_66","text":"I told her that I would cure her, no matter what.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_67","text":"But, when she left, I couldn't stop her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_68","text":"I couldn't say for certain that I would cure her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_69","text":"My so-called promise was just a feeble attempt to get her to stay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_70","text":"It's something I regret dearly... and will until the day I die.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash2_01_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash2_01_s_71","text":"So now I've got to do everything I can to find a cure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":nul